  "step_by_step_reasoning": "Content originators and media outlets interact with the platform via ELB protected by WAF. API/UI traffic routes to App EC2 servers, while raw ad files upload directly to S3. App servers push jobs to SQS queues for asynchronous processing. Transcoding/QC EC2 workers and Batch EC2 workers poll SQS, process assets, and store converted versions in S3. Output content is delivered to Media Outlets directly from S3 or via CloudFront distribution.",
